    "agentic-fulfilment-v3-095505f6ba63358dc482cbc0": {
      "answer": "To set up a full transfer between Robinhood and E*TRADE, follow these steps: 1) Log in to your Robinhood account and go to the 'Transfers' or 'Account' section. 2) Initiate a transfer to an external account, selecting E*TRADE as the recipient. 3) Enter your E*TRADE account information. 4) Confirm the transfer details and submit. 5) Log in to your E*TRADE account to confirm the transfer. 6) If required, complete any additional paperwork or verification steps. Please note that specific steps may vary depending on individual circumstances. For detailed guidance, consult Robinhood and E*TRADE's official support resources.",
